WEBVTT

00:09.625 --> 00:11.280
What you doing up there?

00:11.280 --> 00:13.010
Oh, just fixing some leaks.

00:13.010 --> 00:15.480
Seriously dude, you got some time on your hands.

00:15.480 --> 00:18.640
I got some properties with paying tenants.

00:18.640 --> 00:20.280
What, that’s why you came by?

00:20.280 --> 00:22.520
Just go get me my checks!

00:22.520 --> 00:24.189
See you, Brian.

00:24.190 --> 00:25.560
Love you, Jason.

00:28.220 --> 00:30.560
Hi Jason!

00:50.400 --> 00:51.680
I’m here for Lucia Caminos.

00:51.680 --> 00:53.160
She’s supposed to be getting out.

00:54.030 --> 00:55.080
What’s your name?

00:55.080 --> 00:56.360
Jason Duval.

00:57.080 --> 00:58.600
I seen you here before?

00:59.040 --> 01:00.400
You might have.

01:06.810 --> 01:07.520
Hey.

01:07.810 --> 01:08.520
Hey.

01:14.680 --> 01:15.720
Hands above your head!

01:15.720 --> 01:16.480
Now!

01:16.480 --> 01:17.520
You, stay!

01:19.320 --> 01:20.320
To new beginnings.

01:21.210 --> 01:22.919
You broke my nose, that’s what.

01:26.760 --> 01:28.920
Trust me, this place is just a start for us.

01:28.920 --> 01:30.200
Ring the bell!

01:30.200 --> 01:31.800
Shots baby!

01:31.800 --> 01:34.119
The only thing that matters is who you know

01:34.120 --> 01:35.560
and what you got.

01:37.480 --> 01:38.280
If we’re gonna do this,

01:38.280 --> 01:39.480
we’re doing it right.

01:41.760 --> 01:43.440
Yo D, this fool a Fed?

01:43.880 --> 01:45.920
They got your name, address.

01:45.920 --> 01:47.000
They got everything.

01:48.080 --> 01:50.360
Us cops, we gotta protect each other.

01:51.120 --> 01:53.010
Like, brap brap brap!

01:54.920 --> 01:56.920
You and me Lu, we got this.

01:56.920 --> 01:57.760
We got it.

01:58.200 --> 01:59.440
Whoa!

02:03.640 --> 02:05.600
Say Vice City, baby.

02:05.600 --> 02:07.610
Vice City, baby!

02:09.199 --> 02:11.600
Come to Phil’s Ammu-Nation today!

02:11.600 --> 02:13.605
We got more guns than the law allows.

02:13.605 --> 02:15.920
Woohoo!

02:16.280 --> 02:17.210
Hey.

02:29.560 --> 02:30.605
Hey if you got friends,

02:30.605 --> 02:32.679
can you hook me up please!

02:33.240 --> 02:36.320
Hahaha!
